SUMMARY:AYPROS Mug Club: WOODFIN COFFEE DEPARTMENT 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\n**Start your Thursday 
 with AYPROS at Woodfin Coffee Department!**\n\nIf Pub Club is your after-w
 ork hangout\, Mug Club is the morning version. Coffee instead of cocktails
 \, a little caffeine before the workday\, and the same easy chance to catc
 h up with familiar faces and meet other young professionals from across As
 heville.\n\nFor November\, we're heading to Woodfin Coffee Department\, a 
 locally owned neighborhood coffee shop and bistro near Beaver Lake. Opened
  in 2026 by longtime neighborhood residents Lucy and Jared Crown\, this we
 lcoming spot serves coffee\, breakfast favorites\, locally made pastries\,
  and more. It's a great excuse to explore somewhere new while making a few
  connections along the way.\n\nMug Club is intentionally casual. Leave you
 r business cards at home\, come as you are\, grab a coffee and settle in f
 or a little while. No program. No presentations. No awkward agenda. Just g
 ood coffee and good people before the workday gets going.\n\nComing by you
 rself? Perfectly normal. Haven't been to an AYPROS event before? Even bett
 er. Mug Club is one of the easiest ways to show up\, meet a few people and
  see what AYPROS is all about.\n\n**Your first drip coffee is on us.** Spe
 cialty drinks\, additional coffee and other menu items will be available f
 or purchase.\n\nThis is a come-and-go event\, so arrive when you can and s
 tay as long as your morning allows.\n\n## What to Expect\n\n* A relaxed mo
 rning at Woodfin Coffee Department\n* Your first drip coffee on us\n* Spec
 ialty drinks\, breakfast and other menu items available for purchase\n* Pl
 enty of time to catch up with friends and meet new people\n* No formal pro
 gram\, presentations or agenda\n* Come by yourself\, bring a friend or inv
 ite a coworker\n* Come when you can and head out whenever you need to\n\n#
 # Location\n\n**Woodfin Coffee Department**\n126 Elkwood Avenue\nWoodfin\,
  NC 28804\n**Parking:** A small parking lot is available on-site\, with ad
 ditional parking in the lot across the street.\n\n## Date\n\n**Thursday\, 
 November 12\, 2026**\n\n## Time\n\n**8:30 AM–10:00 AM**\nCome grab a cof
 fee\, spend a little time with Asheville's young professional community\, 
 and start your Thursday somewhere other than your inbox.
